# text = واصنافها ثلثة وذلك اما ان تكون تشبه باشيا اخر والحكاية بها واما ان تكون على عكس هذا وهو ان تكون اشيا اخر تشبه وتحاكى واما ان تجرى على احوال مختلفة لا على جهة واحدة بعينها
# transliteration = wa-aṣnāfuhā thalāthatun wa-dhālika immā an takūna tushabbihu bi-ashyāʾa ukhara wa-l-ḥikāyatu bihā wa-immā an takūna ʿalā ʿaksi hādhā wa-huwa an takūna ashyāʾu ukharu tushabbahu wa-tuḥākā wa-immā an tajriya ʿalā aḥwālin mukhtalifatin lā ʿalā jihatin wāḥidatin bi-ʿaynihā
# prose_translation = Its kinds are three: namely, either that it imitate by means of other things, the narration being by them; or that it be the reverse of this, that is, that other things be likened and imitated; or that it proceed in varied modes, not in one and the same manner.
# literal_translation = And-its-kinds [are] three, and-that [is] either that it-be it-likens by-things other and-the-narration [is] by-them, or that it-be upon reverse of-this, and-it [is] that be things other are-likened and-are-imitated, or that it-proceed upon modes different, not upon manner one in-its-self.
