# sent_id = 1.4
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 1.4
# translation_lang = en
# text = وكما ان الناس قد يشبهون بالوان واشكال كثيرا ويحاكون ذلك من حيث ان بعضهم يشبه بالصناعات ويحاكيها وبعضهم بالعادات وقوم اخر منهم بالاصوات كذلك الصناعات التى وصفنا وجميعها ياتى بالتشبه والحكاية باللحن والقول والنظم وذلك يكون اما على الانفراد واما على جهة الاختلاط
# transliteration = wa-kamā anna l-nāsa qad yushabbihūna bi-alwānin wa-ashkālin kathīran wa-yuḥākūna dhālika min ḥaythu anna baʿḍahum yushabbihu bi-l-ṣināʿāti wa-yuḥākīhā wa-baʿḍahum bi-l-ʿādāti wa-qawmun ākharu minhum bi-l-aṣwāti kadhālika l-ṣināʿātu allatī waṣafnā wa-jamīʿuhā yaʾtī bi-l-tashabbuhi wa-l-ḥikāyati bi-l-laḥni wa-l-qawli wa-l-naẓmi wa-dhālika yakūnu immā ʿalā l-infirādi wa-immā ʿalā jihati l-ikhtilāṭi
# prose_translation = Just as people liken many things with colours and shapes and imitate them, some of them likening by the arts and imitating them, some by habits, and other people among them by voices, so too the arts we have described: all of them bring about likening and narration by melody, speech and composition, and this happens either singly or by way of mixture.
# literal_translation = And-as that the-people indeed liken with-colours and-shapes much and-imitate that, from where that some-of-them likens by-the-arts and-imitates-them, and-some-of-them by-the-habits, and-people other of-them by-the-voices, likewise the-arts which we-described, and-all-of-them brings with-the-likening and-the-narration with-the-melody and-the-speech and-the-composition, and-that is either upon the-singleness or upon manner of-the-mixture.
