# text = مثال ذلك اوليطيقى وصناعة العيدان فانهما تستعملان اللحن وتاليف فقط وان كان توجد صناعات اخر هى فى قوتها مثل هاتين مثل ذلك صناعة الصفر تستعمل اللحن الواحد بعينه من غير تاليف
# transliteration = mithālu dhālika ūlīṭīqī wa-ṣināʿatu l-ʿīdāni fa-innahumā tastaʿmilāni l-laḥna wa-taʾlīfan faqaṭ wa-in kāna tūjadu ṣināʿātun ukharu hiya fī quwwatihā mithlu hātayni mithla dhālika ṣināʿatu l-ṣafri tastaʿmilu l-laḥna l-wāḥida bi-ʿaynihī min ghayri taʾlīfin
# prose_translation = For example, aulētikē and the art of the lutes: these two use melody and composition only; and even if there are other arts which in their power are like these two, for instance the art of the pipe, it uses the one melody by itself, without composition.
# literal_translation = Example-of that aulētikē and-art-of the-lutes, so-verily-they-two use the-melody and-composition only; and-if was are-found arts other, they [are] in their-power like these-two, like that art-of the-pipe uses the-melody the-one in-itself from without composition.
