# text = غير ان الناس عند ما يوصلون وزن صناعة الشعر [يعملون الاوزان و]يسمون بعضها فمن الغايا وبعضها فى الاخر [والتى لها اول واخر] وليس كالتى يعملون الشعر التى هى بالحكاية والتشبيه لكن التى يلقبونها المشتركة فى اوزانها
# transliteration = ghayra anna l-nāsa ʿinda mā yūṣilūna wazna ṣināʿati l-shiʿri [yaʿmalūna l-awzāna wa-]yusammūna baʿḍahā fa-mina l-ghāyā wa-baʿḍahā fī l-ākhiri [wa-llatī lahā awwalun wa-ākhirun] wa-laysa ka-llatī yaʿmalūna l-shiʿra allatī hiya bi-l-ḥikāyati wa-l-tashbīhi lākin allatī yulaqqibūnahā l-mushtarikata fī awzānihā
# prose_translation = Except that people, when they join the metre to the art of poetry, [make the metres and] name some of them "from the ends" (?) and some "in the other" [and those which have a beginning and an end], not as those who make the poetry that consists in narration and likening, but as those whom they call "sharing in their metres".
# literal_translation = Except that the-people when they-join metre-of art-of the-poetry [they-make the-metres and-]they-name some-of-them so-from the-ends, and-some-of-them in the-other [and-which to-it first and-last], and-not like-which they-make the-poetry which it [is] by-the-narration and-the-likening, but which they-call-it the-sharing in its-metres.
