# sent_id = 4.14
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 4.14
# translation_lang = en
# text = فلما حدثت منذ الابتدا ونشت دفعة هى وصناعة الهجا ايضا اما تلك فعند ما كانت تبتدى من العلل الاول التى للمذهب المسمى ايثورمبو واما هذه المزورة وهذه هى الثابتة فى كثير من المداين الى الان احدث النمو والتربية قليلا قليلا من حيث قد كانت قديمة كما انه ظهرت ايضا هذه التى هى الان
# transliteration = fa-lammā ḥadathat mundhu l-ibtidāʾi wa-nashaʾat dafʿatan hiya wa-ṣināʿatu l-hijāʾi ayḍan ammā tilka fa-ʿinda mā kānat tabtadiʾu mina l-ʿilali l-uwali allatī li-l-madhhabi l-musammā īthūrambū wa-ammā hādhihi l-muzawwaratu wa-hādhihi hiya l-thābitatu fī kathīrin mina l-madāʾini ilā l-āna uḥditha l-numuwwu wa-l-tarbiyatu qalīlan qalīlan min ḥaythu qad kānat qadīmatan kamā annahū ẓaharat ayḍan hādhihi allatī hiya l-āna
# prose_translation = When it came into being from the beginning and grew up all at once, it and the art of lampoon as well (the one when it was beginning from the first causes belonging to the school called dithyramb, and the other, the counterfeit one (?), which is the one still established in many of the cities until now), growth and nurture were brought about little by little, inasmuch as it was already ancient, just as this which exists now also appeared.
# literal_translation = So-when it-arose since the-beginning and-grew at-once, it and-art-of the-lampoon also, as-for that so-when was beginning from the-causes the-first which [are] to-the-school the-named dithyramb, and-as-for this the-counterfeit, and-this, it [is] the-established in many of the-cities until now, was-brought-about the-growth and-the-nurture little little, from where indeed it-was ancient, as that-it appeared also this which it [is] now.
