# sent_id = 4.16
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 4.16
# translation_lang = en
# text = واما تلك فلاكثر المنافقين والمرائين فمن واحد للاثنين واول من كان ادخل هذه المذاهب التى للصفوف وللدستبند وهو ايضا اول من اعد مذاهب الجهادات وايضا اول من اظهر هذه الاصناف من اللهو واللعب كان سوفوقلس
# transliteration = wa-ammā tilka fa-li-akthari l-munāfiqīna wa-l-murāʾīna fa-min wāḥidin li-l-ithnayni wa-awwalu man kāna adkhala hādhihi l-madhāhiba allatī li-l-ṣufūfi wa-li-l-dastband wa-huwa ayḍan awwalu man aʿadda madhāhiba l-jihādāti wa-ayḍan awwalu man aẓhara hādhihi l-aṣnāfa mina l-lahwi wa-l-laʿibi kāna Sūfūqlis
# prose_translation = As for that: for the greater number of the hypocrites and dissemblers, [it went] from one to two. And the first who introduced these schools belonging to the rows and to the dastband (he was also the first who prepared the schools of the contests, and also the first who displayed these kinds of amusement and play) was Sophocles.
# literal_translation = And-as-for that, so-for-most-of the-hypocrites and-the-dissemblers, so-from one to-the-two; and-first-of who had introduced these the-schools which [are] to-the-rows and-to-the-dastband, and-he [is] also first-of who prepared schools-of the-contests, and-also first-of who displayed these the-kinds of the-amusement and-the-play, was Sophocles.
