# sent_id = 4.17
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 4.17
# translation_lang = en
# text = وايضا هو اول من اظهر من النشايد الصغار عظم الكلام وصحيح والرهح فى الكلام والمقولات الداخلة فى باب الاستهزا والهزل وعمل ذلك بان غير شى من شكل الفن المسمى سطاوررور واما بالاخرة وبالابطا فاستعملوا العفة وهذا الوزن من الرباعية التى ليامبو
# transliteration = wa-ayḍan huwa awwalu man aẓhara mina l-nashāʾidi l-ṣighāri ʿiẓama l-kalāmi wa-ṣaḥīḥan(?) wa-l-rahḥa(?) fī l-kalāmi wa-l-maqūlāti l-dākhilata fī bābi l-istihzāʾi wa-l-hazli wa-ʿamila dhālika bi-an ghayyara shayʾan min shakli l-fanni l-musammā saṭāwrrūr wa-ammā bi-l-ākhirati wa-bi-l-ibṭāʾi fa-staʿmalū l-ʿiffata wa-hādhā l-waznu mina l-rubāʿiyyati allatī li-yāmbū
# prose_translation = He was also the first who brought forth, out of the small songs, greatness of speech, and sound [speech] (?), and [...] (?) in speech, and utterances belonging to the domain of mockery and jest; and he did this by changing something of the shape of the art called saṭāwrrūr (satyric). As for at last and slowly, they adopted chastity; and this metre is from the tetrameter that belongs to iambos.
# literal_translation = And-also he [is] first-of who brought-forth from the-songs the-small greatness-of the-speech and-sound(?) and-the-?(?) in the-speech and-the-utterances the-entering in domain-of the-mockery and-the-jest; and-he-did that by-that he-changed something of shape-of the-art the-named satyric; and-as-for at-the-last and-at-the-slowness, so-they-used the-chastity; and-this the-metre [is] from the-tetrameter which [is] to-iambos.
