# sent_id = 5.3
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 5.3
# translation_lang = en
# text = فاما العاملون لصناعة المديح ومن اين نشوا وحدثوا فلست اظن انه يعما امرهم فى ذلك ولا يهمل ويسا فاما صناعة الهجا فانه لما كانت غير معتنا بها فانها انسيت وعما امرها منذ الابتدا وذلك ان صفوف الرقاصين والدستبند من اهل الهجا من حيث انما اطلق ذلك او الوالى على اثينية بلاخرة غير ان العمل بذلك انما كان مردود الى اختيارهم وارادتهم
# transliteration = fa-ammā l-ʿāmilūna li-ṣināʿati l-madīḥi wa-min ayna nashaʾū wa-ḥadathū fa-lastu aẓunnu annahū yaʿmā amruhum fī dhālika wa-lā yuhmalu wa-yunsā(?) fa-ammā ṣināʿatu l-hijāʾi fa-innahū lammā kānat ghayra muʿtanan bihā fa-innahā unsiyat wa-ʿamiya amruhā mundhu l-ibtidāʾi wa-dhālika anna ṣufūfa l-raqqāṣīna wa-l-dastband min ahli l-hijāʾi min ḥaythu innamā aṭlaqa dhālika awi l-wālī ʿalā Athīniyata bi-l-ākhirati ghayra anna l-ʿamala bi-dhālika innamā kāna mardūdan ilā ikhtiyārihim wa-irādatihim
# prose_translation = As for those who practise the art of praise, and whence they arose and came about, I do not think that their case in this is obscure, or neglected and forgotten (?). As for the art of lampoon, since it was not attended to, it was forgotten and its case became obscure from the beginning; for the rows of dancers and the dastband belong to the people of lampoon, inasmuch as it was only at last that (?) the governor over Athens permitted this; except that the practice of it was referred only to their choice and will.
# literal_translation = So-as-for the-practitioners of-art-of the-praise and-from where they-arose and-came-about, so-I-am-not thinking that-it is-obscure their-case in that, and-not is-neglected and-is-forgotten(?); so-as-for art-of the-lampoon, so-verily-it, when it-was other-than attended to-it, so-verily-it was-forgotten and-became-obscure its-case since the-beginning; and-that [is] that rows-of the-dancers and-the-dastband [are] of people-of the-lampoon, from where only permitted that or(?) the-governor over Athens at-the-last; except that the-practice of-that only was referred to their-choice and-their-will.
