# text = من حيث كان لهم من جهة شكل ما ان يعدون ممن كان من سراٮها وكانوا يذكرون وبعض الوجوه الذين اعطوا اما تسليم ٮقدمة الكلام او من كثرة المرايين والمنفقين فان جميع من كان مثل هولا لم يعرفون
# transliteration = min ḥaythu kāna lahum min jihati shaklin mā an yuʿaddūna mimman kāna min sarātihā(?) wa-kānū yudhkarūna wa-baʿḍu l-wujūhi alladhīna aʿṭaw immā taslīma taqdimati(?) l-kalāmi aw min kathrati l-murāʾīna wa-l-munfiqīna fa-inna jamīʿa man kāna mithla hāʾulāʾi lam yuʿrafūna
# prose_translation = Inasmuch as it was theirs, by way of some shape, to be counted among those who were of its notables (?), they used to be mentioned. And some of the faces (notables) who gave either the delivery of the preface (?) of speech, or of the multitude of dissemblers and spenders (hypocrites?): all who were like these are not known.
# literal_translation = From where was to-them from direction-of shape some that they-are-counted of-whom was of its-notables(?), and-they-were being-mentioned; and-some-of the-faces who gave either delivery-of preface(?)-of the-speech or of multitude-of the-dissemblers and-the-spenders, so-verily all-of who was like these not are-known.
