# text = ياتون بتشبيه ومحاكاة الامور فليكن اولا من الاضطرار جزو ما من صناعة المديح فى صفة جمال وحسن الوجه وايضا ففى هذه عمل الصوت والنغمة والمقولة وبهذين يفعلون التشبيه والمحاكاة
# transliteration = yaʾtūna bi-tashbīhi wa-muḥākāti l-umūri fa-l-yakun awwalan mina l-iḍṭirāri juzʾun mā min ṣināʿati l-madīḥi fī ṣifati jamāli wa-ḥusni l-wajhi wa-ayḍan fa-fī hādhihi ʿamalu l-ṣawti wa-l-naghmati wa-l-maqūlatu wa-bi-hādhayni yafʿalūna l-tashbīha wa-l-muḥākāta
# prose_translation = They bring about the likening and imitation of the matters; so let there be first, of necessity, some part of the art of praise [consisting] in the description of the beauty and fairness of the face; and also, in these there is the making of voice and tone, and diction; and by these two they make the likening and the imitation.
# literal_translation = They-bring with-likening and-imitation-of the-matters; so-let-be firstly from the-necessity part some of art-of the-praise in description-of beauty and-fairness-of the-face; and-also so-in these [is] making-of the-voice and-the-tone and-the-diction; and-by-these-two they-make the-likening and-the-imitation.
