# sent_id = 6.8
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 6.8
# translation_lang = en
# text = وخرفة الحديث والقصص هى تشبيه ومحاكاة واعنى بالخرافة وحكاية الحديث تركيب الامور واما العادات فبحسب ما عليه ويقال المحدثين والقصاص الذين يرون كيف هم او كيف هى فى اٮراٮهم ويرون كيف هم فى ادلتهم
# transliteration = wa-khurāfatu l-ḥadīthi wa-l-qiṣaṣi hiya tashbīhun wa-muḥākātun wa-aʿnī bi-l-khurāfati wa-ḥikāyati l-ḥadīthi tarkība l-umūri wa-ammā l-ʿādātu fa-bi-ḥasabi mā ʿalayhi wa-yuqālu l-muḥaddithīna wa-l-quṣṣāṣa alladhīna yarawna kayfa hum aw kayfa hiya fī a?rā?him wa-yarawna kayfa hum fī adillatihum
# prose_translation = The tale of story and narratives is a likening and imitation; by "tale" and "narration of the story" I mean the composition of the matters. As for the habits, they are according to what [a person] is in, and [by them] the narrators and storytellers are spoken of, those who see how they are, or how it is, in their […] (?), and see how they are in their proofs.
# literal_translation = And-tale-of the-story and-the-tales it [is] likening and-imitation; and-I-mean by-the-tale and-narration-of the-story composition-of the-matters; and-as-for the-habits, so-according-to what [is] upon-him, and-are-said the-narrators and-the-storytellers who see how they [are], or how it [is], in their-[…], and-see how they [are] in their-proofs.
