# text = وقد يجب ضرورة ان يكون جميع اجزا صناعة المديح ستة اجزا بحسب اى شى كانت هذه الصناعة وهذه الاجزا هى هذه الخرافات والعادات والمقولة والاعتقاد والنظر والنغمة الصوت
# transliteration = wa-qad yajibu ḍarūratan an yakūna jamīʿu ajzāʾi ṣināʿati l-madīḥi sittata ajzāʾin bi-ḥasabi ayyi shayʾin kānat hādhihi l-ṣināʿatu wa-hādhihi l-ajzāʾu hiya hādhihi l-khurāfātu wa-l-ʿādātu wa-l-maqūlatu wa-l-iʿtiqādu wa-l-naẓaru wa-l-naghmatu l-ṣawtu
# prose_translation = Necessarily, then, all the parts of the art of praise must be six parts, according to what sort of thing this art is; and these parts are these: the tales, the habits, the diction, the belief, the sight, and the tone, the voice.
# literal_translation = And-indeed it-is-necessary necessarily that be all parts-of art-of the-praise six parts, according-to which thing was this the-art; and-these the-parts they [are] these: the-tales and-the-habits and-the-diction and-the-belief and-the-sight and-the-tone the-voice.
