# text = وانما يعرضون ويتحدثون لكيما يشبهون بعاداتهم ويحاكونها غير ان العادات يعرضونها بسبب اعمالهم حتى يكون الامور [والامور] والخرافات اخر صناعة المديح والكمال نفسه هو اعظمها جميعا
# transliteration = wa-innamā yaʿriḍūna wa-yataḥaddathūna li-kaymā yushabbihūna bi-ʿādātihum wa-yuḥākūnahā ghayra anna l-ʿādāti yaʿriḍūnahā bi-sababi aʿmālihum ḥattā yakūna l-umūru [wa-l-umūru] wa-l-khurāfātu ākhira ṣināʿati l-madīḥi wa-l-kamālu nafsuhū huwa aʿẓamuhā jamīʿan
# prose_translation = They present and narrate only so that they may liken by their habits and imitate them; except that the habits they present because of their actions, so that the matters [and the matters] and the tales are the end of the art of praise; and the perfection itself is the greatest of them all.
# literal_translation = And-only they-present and-narrate in-order-that they-liken by-their-habits and-imitate-them; except that the-habits they-present-them because-of their-actions, so-that be the-matters [and-the-matters] and-the-tales last-of art-of the-praise; and-the-perfection itself it [is] the-greatest-of-them all.
