# prose_translation = As for the sight, it consoles the soul, except that it is without art and is not at all appropriate to the art of the poets, because it is the power of the art of praise, even without the contest, and it is from (?) the hypocrites; and further, the completion of the work of the art of the […] (?) is more deserving of realization in sight than the art of the poets.
