# text = وايضا على الحيون الخير وكل امر لا يتركب شى وليس انما ينبغى ان تكون هذه فقط منتظمة مرتبة لكن قد ينبغى ان يكون العظم لا اى عظم اتفق من قبل ان معنى لا وجود انما يكون بالعظم والترتيب
# transliteration = wa-ayḍan ʿalā l-ḥayawāni l-khayri wa-kulli amrin lā yatarakkabu shayʾun wa-laysa innamā yanbaghī an takūna hādhihi faqaṭ muntaẓimatan murattabatan lākin qad yanbaghī an yakūna l-ʿiẓamu lā ayyu ʿiẓamin ittafaqa min qibali anna maʿnā lā wujūdin innamā yakūnu bi-l-ʿiẓami wa-l-tartībi
# prose_translation = Further, regarding the good animal and every matter of which nothing is composed (?): it is not only necessary that these be ordered and arranged, but it is also necessary that there be magnitude, not any magnitude that happens; because the meaning of "no existence" (?) is only by magnitude and order.
# literal_translation = And-also upon the-animal the-good and-every matter not is-composed thing; and-not-is only it-is-fitting that be these only ordered arranged, but indeed it-is-fitting that be the-magnitude, not any magnitude happened; from account-of that meaning-of no existence only is by-the-magnitude and-the-order.
