# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 7.9
# translation_lang = en
# text = ولذلك ليس حيوان ما صغير هو جبد وذلك ان النظر هو مركب لقرب الزمان لغير محسوس من حيث يكون ليس فى الكل عظيم وذلك ان النظر ليس يكون معا لكن حالها حال يجعل الناظرين واحد وكل وذلك من النظر مثلا مثل ان يكون الحيوان على بعد عشرة الف ميدان
# transliteration = wa-li-dhālika laysa ḥayawānun mā ṣaghīrun huwa jayyidan(?) wa-dhālika anna l-naẓara huwa murakkabun li-qurbi l-zamāni li-ghayri maḥsūsin min ḥaythu yakūnu laysa fī l-kulli ʿaẓīmun wa-dhālika anna l-naẓara laysa yakūnu maʿan lākin ḥāluhā ḥālu yajʿalu l-nāẓirīna wāḥidan wa-kullan wa-dhālika mina l-naẓari mathalan mithla an yakūna l-ḥayawānu ʿalā buʿdi ʿasharati alfi maydānin
# prose_translation = Therefore no small animal is good (?); for sight is composite (?) owing to the nearness of the time to the imperceptible, inasmuch as there is nothing great in the whole; and sight does not occur all at once, but its state is the state of [something that] makes the viewers one and whole, and that comes from sight; for example, as if the animal were at a distance of ten thousand stadia.
# literal_translation = And-for-that not-is animal some small it good(?); and-that [is] that the-sight it [is] composite for-nearness-of the-time to-other-than sensible, from where is not-is in the-whole great; and-that [is] that the-sight not is together, but its-state [is] state-of [what] makes the-viewers one and-whole; and-that [is] from the-sight; for-example like that be the-animal upon distance-of ten thousand stadion.
