# text = حتى يكون كما يجٮ على الاجسام وعلى الحيوان ان يكون عظم ما وهذا نفسه يكون سهل البيان وبهذا نفسه يكون فى الخرافة ايضا طول ويكون محفوظ فى الذكر
# transliteration = ḥattā yakūna kamā yajibu(?) ʿalā l-ajsāmi wa-ʿalā l-ḥayawāni an yakūna ʿiẓamun mā wa-hādhā nafsuhū yakūnu sahla l-bayāni wa-bi-hādhā nafsihī yakūnu fī l-khurāfati ayḍan ṭūlun wa-yakūnu maḥfūẓan fī l-dhikri
# prose_translation = So that it is: just as it is necessary for bodies and for the animal that there be a certain magnitude, and that this itself be easy to make clear, so by this very [measure] there is length in the tale too, and it is preserved in memory.
