# prose_translation = As for length itself, its limit with respect to the contest and perception is the one that belongs to the art. For if every one of the people had had to perform the contest with praise for about three water-hours, he would have used the clepsydra for the contest, as we are accustomed to say at some time.
# literal_translation = And-as-for for-length-of itself, so-its-limit toward the-contest and-the-perception [is] which [is] for-the-art; and-that [is] that-it if was each one of the-people indeed was is-necessary that he-do with-the-praise the-contest toward three hours-of the-water, verily-indeed was uses the-contest clepsydra, as from our-habit that we-say in time some.
