# text = والحرافة وحكاية الحديث فليست كما ظن قوم انها ان كانت الى الواحد وذلك ان اشيا كثيرة بلا نهاية تعرض لواحد وهذه للبعض والافراد وليس شى واحد وكذلك قد تكن اعمال كثيرة هى لواحد وهذه لا يكون ولا واحد منها عمل واحد
# transliteration = wa-l-khurāfatu(?) wa-ḥikāyatu l-ḥadīthi fa-laysat kamā ẓanna qawmun annahā in kānat ilā l-wāḥidi wa-dhālika anna ashyāʾa kathīratan bi-lā nihāyatin taʿriḍu li-wāḥidin wa-hādhihi li-l-baʿḍi wa-l-afrādi wa-laysa shayʾun wāḥidun wa-kadhālika qad takun aʿmālun kathīratun hiya li-wāḥidin wa-hādhihi lā yakūnu wa-lā wāḥidun minhā ʿamalan wāḥidan
# prose_translation = The tale and the narration of the story are not as some people thought, [namely one] if it concerns one [person]; for many things without end befall one [person], and these belong to some and to individuals, and there is not one thing; and likewise there may be many actions that belong to one [person], and of these not even one is a single action.
# literal_translation = And-the-tale and-narration-of the-story, so-not-is as thought people that-it if it-was to the-one; and-that [is] that things many with-no end befall to-one, and-these [are] for-the-some and-the-individuals, and-not-is thing one; and-likewise indeed be actions many they [are] for-one, and-these not is and-not one of-them action one.
