# sent_id = 8.4
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 8.4
# translation_lang = en
# text = فقد يجب اذا ان التشبهات والمحاكات الاخر ان يكون التشبيه والحماكاة الواحدة لواحد وكذلك الخرافة فى العمل هى تشبيه ومحاكاة واحدة لواحد وهذا كله الاجزا ايضا تقوم الامور هكذى حتى اذا نقل الانسان جزو ما او دفع يفسد ويتشوش ويضطرب كله باسره وذلك ان ما هو قريب ان لم يقرب لم يفعل شيا ويبلغ ان يكون كله نحو لا شى هو جزو للكل نفسه
# transliteration = fa-qad yajibu idhan anna l-tashabbuhāti wa-l-muḥākāti l-ukhara an yakūna l-tashbīhu wa-l-muḥākātu(?) l-wāḥidatu li-wāḥidin wa-kadhālika l-khurāfatu fī l-ʿamali hiya tashbīhun wa-muḥākātun wāḥidatun li-wāḥidin wa-hādhā kullihī l-ajzāʾu ayḍan tuqawwimu l-umūra hākadhā ḥattā idhā naqala l-insānu juzʾan mā aw dafaʿa yafsudu wa-yatashawwashu wa-yaḍṭaribu kulluhū bi-asrihī wa-dhālika anna mā huwa qarībun in lam yaqrub lam yafʿal shayʾan wa-yablughu an yakūna kulluhū naḥwa lā shayʾin huwa juzʾun li-l-kulli nafsihī
# prose_translation = So it is necessary, then, that the other likenings and imitations — that the likening and the imitation be one, of one [thing]; and likewise the tale, in action, is one likening and imitation of one [thing] and of this whole; the parts, too, constitute the matters thus, so that if a man moves some part or removes it, the whole is corrupted, disturbed and agitated entirely. For what is near, if it does not come near, does nothing, and comes to be, all of it, as nothing that is a part of the whole itself.
# literal_translation = So-indeed it-is-necessary then that the-likenings and-the-imitations the-other that be the-likening and-the-imitation the-one of-one; and-likewise the-tale in the-action it [is] likening and-imitation one of-one and-this all-of-it; the-parts also constitute the-matters thus, so-that when moved the-man part some or removed, is-corrupted and-is-disturbed and-is-agitated all-of-it in-its-entirety; and-that [is] that what it [is] near, if not it-nears, not it-does thing, and-reaches that be all-of-it toward no thing it [is] part of-the-whole itself.
