# sent_id = 9.3
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 9.3
# translation_lang = en
# text = ولذلك صارت صناعة الشعر هى اكثر فلسفية واكثر فى باب ما هى حريصة من ايسطوريا الامور من قبل ان صناعة الشعر هى كلية اكثر واما ايسطوريا فانما تقول وتخبر بالجزويات
# transliteration = wa-li-dhālika ṣārat ṣināʿatu l-shiʿri hiya akthara falsafiyyatan wa-akthara fī bābi mā hiya ḥarīṣatun min īsṭūriyā l-umūri min qibali anna ṣināʿata l-shiʿri hiya kulliyyatun akthara wa-ammā īsṭūriyā fa-innamā taqūlu wa-tukhbiru bi-l-juzʾiyyāti
# prose_translation = For that reason the art of poetry has become more philosophical, and more [so] in the matter of what it is eager for (?), than the historia of affairs; because the art of poetry is more universal, whereas historia only speaks and reports about particulars.
# literal_translation = And-for-that became art-of the-poetry, it [is], more philosophical-ness and-more in chapter-of what it [is] eager, than historia-of the-affairs; from account-of that art-of the-poetry it [is] universal more; and-as-for historia, so-only it-says and-it-reports with-the-particulars.
