# prose_translation = In what is said by the art of lampoon, then, this has already become evident: for when they composed the tale through what was necessary, it is not whatever names they had assigned, nor as they do with the singulars and particulars, that which is in iambus (?).
# literal_translation = So-in which is-said by-art-of the-lampoon, so-this indeed became-evident this; and-that [is] that-it, when they-composed the-tale by-which was is-necessary, is-not which-of the-names which they-had placed, and-not as they-do concerning the-singulars and-the-particulars, which [is] in iambus.
