# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 9.7
# translation_lang = en
# text = وليس ذلك الا فى المدايح الافراد والبعض وهى التى منها فى الواحدة اثنتين من التى هى من الذين هم معروفون هو لهذه التى فعل لاشيا اخر اسم واحد واما فى الافراد والبعض فولا شى بمنزلة من يضع ان الخير هو واحد وان فى ذلك الامر والاسم انفعالا او فعلا على مثال واحـ*و*ٮس الانتفاع بهما بالاقل
# transliteration = wa-laysa dhālika illā fī l-madāʾiḥi l-afrādi wa-l-baʿḍi wa-hiya allatī minhā fī l-wāḥidati ithnatayni mina llatī hiya mina lladhīna hum maʿrūfūna huwa li-hādhihi allatī faʿala li-ashyāʾa ukhara ismun wāḥidun wa-ammā fī l-afrādi wa-l-baʿḍi fa-wa-lā shayʾa bi-manzilati man yaḍaʿu anna l-khayra huwa wāḥidun wa-anna fī dhālika l-amri wa-l-ismi infiʿālan aw fiʿlan ʿalā mithāli wāḥ*w*ys(?) al-intifāʿu bihimā bi-l-aqalli
# prose_translation = That is only in the individual praises, and some [of them]: it is that in which, in one of them, there are two of those that belong to those who are known; [for] these which he made, for other things, there is one name (?). As for the individual ones and some, there is nothing [of the kind], as with one who posits that the good is one, and that in that matter and the name there is passion or action alike […] the benefit from them less (?).
# literal_translation = And-not-is that except in the-praises the-individual and-the-some; and-it [is] which of-them in the-one two, of which it [is] of who they [are] known; it [is]: to-these which he-made for-things other [is] name one; and-as-for in the-individual and-the-some, so-and-no thing, like-rank-of who puts that the-good it [is] one, and-that in that the-matter and-the-name [is] passion or action upon likeness-of [...] the-benefit by-them by-the-less.
