# sent_id = 9.8
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 9.8
# translation_lang = en
# text = حتى لا ينبغى ان نطلب لا محالة المفيد للخرافات التى تكون نحوها المدايح ان يوجد بها وذلك ان الطلب لهذا هو مما يضحك منه من قبل ان الدلايل موجودة غير ان تسر الكل
# transliteration = ḥattā lā yanbaghī an naṭluba lā maḥālata l-mufīda li-l-khurāfāti allatī takūnu naḥwahā l-madāʾiḥu an yūjada bihā wa-dhālika anna l-ṭalaba li-hādhā huwa mimmā yuḍḥaku minhu min qibali anna l-dalāʾila mawjūdatun ghayra anna tasurru l-kulla
# prose_translation = So that we ought not to seek by all means that what is useful be found in the tales around which the praises turn; for seeking this is among the things that are laughed at, because the indications (?) exist, except that they please everyone.
# literal_translation = So-that not it-is-fitting that we-seek, no avoiding, the-useful for-the-tales which are around-them the-praises, that it-be-found in-them; and-that [is] that the-seeking for-this, it [is] from-what is-laughed at-it, from account-of that the-indications [are] existent, except that they-please the-all.
