# text = فظاهر من هذه ان شاعر خاصة يكون شاعر الخرافات والاوزان بمبلغ ما يكون شاعرا بالتشبيه والمحاكاة وهو يشبه ويحاكى الاعمال والافعال الارادية
# transliteration = fa-ẓāhirun min hādhihi anna shāʿiran khāṣṣatan yakūnu shāʿira l-khurāfāti wa-l-awzāni bi-mablaghi mā yakūnu shāʿiran bi-l-tashbīhi wa-l-muḥākāti wa-huwa yushabbihu wa-yuḥākī l-aʿmāla wa-l-afʿāla l-irādiyyata
# prose_translation = It is evident from these things, then, that a poet especially is a poet of tales and metres, to the degree that he is a poet by likening and imitation; and he likens and imitates actions and voluntary deeds.
# literal_translation = So-evident from these that poet especially is poet-of the-tales and-the-metres, by-extent-of what he-is poet by-the-likening and-the-imitation; and-he likens and-imitates the-actions and-the-deeds the-voluntary.
