# sent_id = 9.10
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 9.10
# translation_lang = en
# text = وان عرض ان يعمل شى فى التى قد كانت فليس هو فى ذلك شاعرا بالدون من قبل ان التى كانت منها ما لا مانع يمنع يكون حالها فى ذلك مثلا كالتى هى موضوعة بان توجد كحال ذاك الذى هو شاعرها
# transliteration = wa-in ʿaraḍa an yuʿmala shayʾun fī allatī qad kānat fa-laysa huwa fī dhālika shāʿiran bi-l-dūni min qibali anna allatī kānat minhā mā lā māniʿa yamnaʿu yakūnu ḥāluhā fī dhālika mathalan ka-llatī hiya mawḍūʿatun bi-an tūjada ka-ḥāli dhāka alladhī huwa shāʿiruhā
# prose_translation = And if it happens that something is made out of what has actually been, he is not on that account a lesser poet; for among the things that have been there is that which nothing prevents from being, in that respect, for example, like what is posited to exist, as is the case of that one who is its poet.
# literal_translation = And-if happened that is-made thing in which indeed was, so-not-is he in that poet by-the-lesser; from account-of that which was, of-it [is] what no preventer prevents, is its-state in that for-example like-which it [is] posited by-that it-be-found, like-state-of that-one who he [is] its-poet.
