# text = واما للخرافات المعلولة فالافعال الارادية ايضا معلولة واعنى بالخرافة المدخولة المعلولة تلك التى المعلولين على الاضطرار واحد بعد اخر ليس يكون من الضرورة ولا على طريق الحق
# transliteration = wa-ammā li-l-khurāfāti l-maʿlūlati fa-l-afʿālu l-irādiyyatu ayḍan maʿlūlatun wa-aʿnī bi-l-khurāfati l-madkhūlati l-maʿlūlati tilka allatī l-maʿlūlīna ʿalā l-iḍṭirāri wāḥidun baʿda ākhara laysa yakūnu mina l-ḍarūrati wa-lā ʿalā ṭarīqi l-ḥaqqi
# prose_translation = As for defective tales, the voluntary actions too are defective. By the corrupt, defective tale I mean the one in which the defective [parts], by compulsion, one after another, are not from necessity, nor by way of truth.
# literal_translation = And-as-for to-the-tales the-defective, so-the-actions the-voluntary also [are] defective; and-I-mean by-the-tale the-corrupt the-defective that which the-defective-ones upon the-compulsion, one after another, not is from the-necessity and-not upon way-of the-truth.
