# text = ومثل بعمل اما من الشعر فمن المزورين المزيفين منهم بسببها واما الشعر الاخيار فبسبب المنافقين والمرايين واما وعند ما يعملون الجهادات فليس يمتدون بالخرافة فوق الطاقة واحيانا وكثير ما قد يضطرون الى ان يردوا ويعدوا الخرافة التى ٮٮـقا من ان قبل
# transliteration = wa-mithlu bi-ʿamalin ammā mina l-shiʿri fa-mina l-muzawwirīna l-muzayyifīna minhum bi-sababihā wa-ammā l-shiʿru l-akhyāru fa-bi-sababi l-munāfiqīna wa-l-murāʾīna wa-ammā wa-ʿinda mā yaʿmalūna l-jihādāti fa-laysa yamtaddūna bi-l-khurāfati fawqa l-ṭāqati wa-aḥyānan wa-kathīran mā qad yuḍṭarrūna ilā an yaruddū wa-yaʿdū(?) l-khurāfata allatī tabqā(?) min an qablu
# prose_translation = The like [comes about] through making (?): as for [what comes] from poetry, it comes from the counterfeiters, the forgers among them, because of it; as for the good poets (?), it is because of the hypocrites and dissemblers. And as for when they compose the struggles, they do not stretch the tale beyond [its] capacity; and sometimes, and often, they are forced to turn back and to overstep (?) the tale which remains (?) from before (?).
# literal_translation = And-like by-making; as-for from the-poetry, so-from the-counterfeiters the-forgers of-them, by-cause-of-it; and-as-for the-poetry the-good, so-by-cause-of the-hypocrites and-the-dissemblers; and-as-for and-when they-make the-struggles, so-not-are they-stretch with-the-tale above the-capacity; and-sometimes and-often indeed they-are-forced to that they-return and-overstep the-tale which remains(?) from that before.
