# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 11.3
# translation_lang = en
# text = وهو انه غير ما كان يجا به فى محنة من قبل انه كان مزمعا ان يموت فان اناوس لما جا خلفه ليقتله اما هذا على ما ذكر قيما كتب به من ذلك عرض له ان يموت واما ذاك فعرض له انه سلم ونجا
# transliteration = wa-huwa annahū ghayru mā kāna yujāʾu bihī fī miḥnatin min qibali annahū kāna muzmiʿan an yamūta fa-inna Anāwus lammā jāʾa khalfahū li-yaqtulahū ammā hādhā ʿalā mā dhukira qīmā(?) kutiba bihī min dhālika ʿaraḍa lahū an yamūta wa-ammā dhāka fa-ʿaraḍa lahū annahū salima wa-najā
# prose_translation = That is, he is other than the one who was being brought in an ordeal (?), because he was about to die; and Danaus, when he came after him to kill him: as for this one, according to what is reported in what (?) was written about that, it befell him to die; as for that one, it befell him that he was saved and escaped.
# literal_translation = And-it [is] that-he [is] other-than what was is-brought with-him in ordeal, from account-of that-he was about that he-die; so-verily Danaus, when came behind-him to-kill-him, as-for this, upon what was-mentioned [in-what] was-written about-it of that, befell to-him that he-die; and-as-for that-one, so-befell to-him that-he was-saved and-escaped.
