# prose_translation = But this one among them is especially [a matter of] the tale, and this is the proper [recognition] of action, I mean the one mentioned. With such recognition and reversal there is either pity or fear, just as it has been posited that the tragic action is likening and imitation; and also success and prosperity, and non-success (?) and prosperity, come about in […].
# literal_translation = But this of-it [is] tale especially, and-this it [is] proper-of action, I-mean what was-said; and-like this the-recognition and-the-reversal, either is with-it pity or fear, like what [is] that-it was-posited that the-action the-tragic it [is] the-likening and-the-imitation; and-also and-the-success and-the-prosperity and-the-non-success(?) and-prosperity in [...] they-two-happen.
