# sent_id = 11.8
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 11.8
# translation_lang = en
# text = من قبل الاستدلال لقوم ما هو استدلال من انسان ما الى رفيقه وهو يكون عند ما يعرف ذاك الامر هو فقط واما متى كان يجب ان يكون كليهما يسدلان ويتعرفان فان مثل ما استدلت ووقفت المراة المسماة افاغانيا على اورسطس من رانفاذ رسالته اما ذاك فكان يحتاج الى الاستدلال وتعرف اخر اعنى فى امر افاغانيا
# transliteration = min qibali l-istidlāli li-qawmin mā huwa istidlālun min insānin mā ilā rafīqihī wa-huwa yakūnu ʿinda mā yaʿrifu dhāka l-amra huwa faqaṭ wa-ammā matā kāna yajibu an yakūna kilayhimā yasdalāni(?) wa-yataʿarrafāni fa-inna mithla mā istadallat wa-waqafati l-marʾatu l-musammātu Afāghāniyā ʿalā Ūrasṭus min rānfādhi(?) risālatihī ammā dhāka fa-kāna yaḥtāju ilā l-istidlāli wa-taʿarrufin ākhara aʿnī fī amri Afāghāniyā
# prose_translation = Since the recognition belonging to certain people is a recognition by some person of his companion; and that happens when that one alone knows the matter. But when both of them had to recognize and know each other, then, as the woman named Iphigenia recognized and discovered Orestes from the sending (?) of his letter, that one needed another recognition and knowing, I mean concerning Iphigenia.
# literal_translation = From account-of the-recognition to-people some, it [is] recognition from man some to his-companion; and-it happens when knows that-one the-matter, he only; and-as-for when was it-is-necessary that are both-of-them recognize(?) and-know-each-other, so-verily like what recognized and-discovered the-woman the-named Iphigenia upon Orestes from sending(?)-of his-letter, as-for that-one so-was needs to the-recognition and-knowing other, I-mean in matter-of Iphigenia.
