# text = واما اجزا صناعة المديح فينبغى ان يستعمل بعضها فكما يستعمل الانواع واما كيف ذلك فقد خبرنا فيما تقدم واما بحسب الكمية فاى الاشيا ينقسم فنحن مخبرون الان وهذه الاجزا هى ٮقدمة الخطب والمدخل ومخرج الرقص الذى للصفوف
# transliteration = wa-ammā ajzāʾu ṣināʿati l-madīḥi fa-yanbaghī an yustaʿmala baʿḍuhā fa-kamā yustaʿmalu l-anwāʿu wa-ammā kayfa dhālika fa-qad khabbarnā fīmā taqaddama wa-ammā bi-ḥasabi l-kammiyyati fa-ayya l-ashyāʾi yanqasimu fa-naḥnu mukhbirūna l-āna wa-hādhihi l-ajzāʾu hiya taqdimatu(?) l-khuṭabi wa-l-madkhalu wa-makhraju l-raqṣi alladhī li-l-ṣufūfi
# prose_translation = As for the parts of the art of praise, some of them ought to be used as the kinds are used; how that is, we have reported in what preceded. As for [the parts] according to quantity, into which things it is divided, we are now reporting: these parts are the preface (?) of the speeches, the entrance, and the exit of the dance, which belongs to the rows.
# literal_translation = And-as-for parts-of art-of the-praise, so-it-is-fitting that be-used some-of-them, so-as are-used the-kinds; and-as-for how that [is], so-indeed we-reported in-what preceded; and-as-for by-measure-of the-quantity, so-which-of the-things it-divides, so-we [are] reporting now: and-these the-parts, it [is] preface(?)-of the-speeches and-the-entrance and-exit-of the-dance which [is] for-the-rows.
