# prose_translation = And they are those in some of which one conjectures (?), and some of them those against which one guards in composing the tales. As for the place from which the work of the art of praise is found, we shall report on it later, and add that to what has preceded and been said.
# literal_translation = And-they [are] those-which one-conjectures(?) in some-of-them a-conjecture(?), and-some-of-them [are] those-which one-guards by-them at composition-of the-tales; so-as-for from which place is-found work-of art-of the-praise, so-we [are] reporting in-what [is] after, and-we-add that to what preceded, so-was-said.
