# transliteration = wa-lā ayḍan yurwā li-l-taʿibīna min lā falāḥin ilā falāḥin wa-najḥin dhālika anna hādhihi bi-ajmaʿihā hiya ghayru madīḥiyyatin wa-dhālika anna laysa fīhā shayʾun mimmā yajibu lā allatī li-maḥabbati l-insāniyyati wa-lā allatī li-l-ḥuzni
# prose_translation = Nor again is it related of the wretched [that they pass] from non-success to success and prosperity; that is because these are altogether not praise-like, for there is nothing in them of what is required, neither what belongs to love of humanity nor what belongs to grief.
