# sent_id = 13.6
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 13.6
# translation_lang = en
# text = والخرافة التى تجرى على الاجود فلا تخلوا من ان تكون كما قال قوم بسيطة واما مركبة وان تغير لا من لا فلاح من فلاح لكن بالعكس اعنى من الفلاح الى لا فلاح لا بسبب التعب لكن بسب خطا وذلك عظيم او مثل التى قيلت الافاضل خاصة اكثر من الارذال
# transliteration = wa-l-khurāfatu allatī tajrī ʿalā l-ajwadi fa-lā takhlū min an takūna kamā qāla qawmun basīṭatan wa-immā murakkabatan wa-an tataghayyara lā min lā falāḥin min falāḥin lākin bi-l-ʿaksi aʿnī mina l-falāḥi ilā lā falāḥin lā bi-sababi l-taʿabi lākin bi-sababi khaṭaʾin wa-dhālika ʿaẓīmun aw mithli allatī qīlat al-afāḍili khāṣṣatan akthara mina l-arādhili
# prose_translation = The tale that runs in the best way cannot but be, as some people have said, simple or compound, and change not from non-success to success but the reverse, I mean from success to non-success, not because of toil but because of an error, and that a great one, or [one] like what has been said: the virtuous especially, more than the base.
# literal_translation = And-the-tale which runs upon the-best, so-not it-is-free from that it-be, as said people, simple or compound, and-that it-change not from non-success from success, but by-the-reverse, I-mean from the-success to non-success, not by-cause-of the-toil but by-cause-of error, and-that [being] great, or like-of which was-said, the-virtuous especially more than the-base.
