# text = واما القوام الثانى فقد يقول فيها بعض الٯوام انها اولى وهى مضاعفة فى قوامها بمنزلة التدوين الذى للجوهر واذا حصلت على جهة الرواية من التضاد فقد يظن بها انها للافاضل جدا والارذال
# transliteration = wa-ammā l-qiwāmu l-thānī fa-qad yaqūlu fīhā baʿḍu l-aqwāmi (?) innahā ūlā wa-hiya muḍāʿafatun fī qiwāmihā bi-manzilati l-tadwīni alladhī li-l-jawhari wa-idhā ḥaṣalat ʿalā jihati l-riwāyati mina l-taḍāddi fa-qad yuẓannu bihā annahā li-l-afāḍili jiddan wa-l-arādhili
# prose_translation = As for the second structure, some people (?) say of it that it is the first; it is doubled in its structure, like the "compilation" (?) that belongs to substance; and when it comes about by way of narration from contrariety, it is thought to be for the very virtuous and for the base.
# literal_translation = And-as-for the-structure the-second, so-indeed says about-it some-of the-peoples(?) that-it [is] first; and-it [is] doubled in its-structure, in-the-rank-of the-compilation which [is] for-the-substance; and-when it-came-about upon manner-of the-narration from the-contrariety, so-indeed is-thought of-it that-it [is] for-the-virtuous very and-the-base.
