# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 14.15
# translation_lang = en
# text = ولا شيا خارجا عن هذه يجرى على جهة اخرى وذلك انه قد يجب ضرورة اما ان يفعل واما الا يفعل [واذا فعل فاما ان يفعل وهو عارف واما ان يفعل وهو غير عارف بل مزمع بان يعرف] وايضا اما للذين يعرفون واما للذين لا يعرفون
# transliteration = wa-lā shayʾan khārijan ʿan hādhihi yajrī ʿalā jihatin ukhrā wa-dhālika annahū qad yajibu ḍarūratan immā an yafʿala wa-immā allā yafʿala [wa-idhā faʿala fa-immā an yafʿala wa-huwa ʿārifun wa-immā an yafʿala wa-huwa ghayru ʿārifin bal muzmiʿun bi-an yaʿrifa] wa-ayḍan immā li-lladhīna yaʿrifūna wa-immā li-lladhīna lā yaʿrifūna
# prose_translation = Nothing outside these proceeds in any other way. For necessarily one either acts or does not act [and if he acts, then either he acts knowing, or he acts not knowing but about to know], and further either [it is] for those who know or for those who do not know.
# literal_translation = And-no thing outside from these runs upon manner other; and-that [is] that-it indeed is-necessary necessarily either that he-does or that-not he-does [and-when he-did, so-either that he-does and-he [is] knowing, or that he-does and-he [is] other-than knowing but resolved to-that he-knows], and-also either for-those-who know or for-those-who not know.
