# subdoc = 14.19
# translation_lang = en
# text = وما اصلح واجود ما يروى اعنى ما كان فى الموضع المسمى اسڡٮلوٯٮطس من المراة المسمى ميروا فيما كانت مستعدة لقتل احد بنيها الا انها لم تقتله لكن تعرفت فى الموضع المعروف ٮااٮٮعاٮٮا اخت لاخيها وتعرف فى الموضع المسما ايلى الابن امه وتعرفها عند ما كان يريد انشادا ورواية
# transliteration = wa-mā aṣlaḥa wa-ajwada mā yurwā aʿnī mā kāna fī l-mawḍiʿi l-musammā Asf?lūq?ṭs (?) mina l-marʾati l-musammā Mīrwā fīmā kānat mustaʿiddatan li-qatli aḥadi banīhā illā annahā lam taqtulhu lākin taʿarrafat fī l-mawḍiʿi l-maʿrūfi ?āa??ʿā??ā (?) ukhtun li-akhīhā wa-taʿarrafa fī l-mawḍiʿi l-musammā Īlī l-ibnu ummahū wa-taʿarrafahā ʿinda mā kāna yurīdu inshādan wa-riwāyatan
# prose_translation = How fitting and how excellent is what is related! I mean what took place in the place called Cresphontes (?), from the woman called Merope, when she was ready to kill one of her sons but did not kill him and instead recognized [him]; and in the place known as … (Iphigenia?), a sister [recognized] her brother; and in the place called Helle the son recognized his mother, and recognized her when he wanted recitation and narration (?).
# literal_translation = And-how fitting and-excellent what is-related! I-mean what was in the-place the-named Cresphontes(?) from the-woman the-named Merope, in-that was prepared for-killing-of one-of her-sons, except that-she not killed-him but recognized; in the-place the-known ?(Iphigenia?) a-sister to-her-brother; and-recognized in the-place the-named Helle the-son his-mother, and-recognized-her when was wanting recitation and-narration.
