# sent_id = 14.20
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 14.20
# translation_lang = en
# text = فلهذا السبب عند ما تفوهت وتكلم بها اعنى بالمدايح منذ قديم الدهر ليست عند اجناس كثيرة ويباحث عنها لا من الصناعة لكن من اى حال كانت من ما وجدوا واعدوها بالخرافات فقد يضطرون ان ٮٮٯلوا هذه فى مثل هذه التاثيرات والالام التى تعرض لها بحسب الخواص
# transliteration = fa-li-hādhā l-sababi ʿinda mā tafawwahat wa-tukullima bihā aʿnī bi-l-madāʾiḥi mundhu qadīmi l-dahri laysat ʿinda ajnāsin kathīratin wa-yubāḥathu ʿanhā lā mina l-ṣināʿati lākin min ayyi ḥālin kānat min mā wajadū wa-aʿaddūhā bi-l-khurāfāti fa-qad yuḍṭarrūna an yanqulū (?) hādhihi fī mithli hādhihi l-taʾthīrāti wa-l-ālāmi allatī taʿriḍu lahā bi-ḥasabi l-khawāṣṣi
# prose_translation = For this reason, when they were uttered and spoken of from ancient times — I mean the praises — they have not been about many kinds; and they are investigated not from the art but from whatever state they happened to be in, from what [poets] found and prepared with tales. So they are compelled to transfer (?) these into such affections and pains as befall them according to the particular [cases].
# literal_translation = So-for-this the-cause, when they-were-uttered and-was-spoken of-them, I-mean of-the-praises, since ancient-of the-time, [they] are-not at kinds many; and-is-investigated about-them not from the-art but from which state it-was, from what they-found and-prepared-them with-the-tales; so-indeed they-are-compelled that they-transfer(?) these in like-of these the-affections and-the-pains which happen to-them according-to the-particulars.
