# sent_id = 15.10c
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 15.10c
# translation_lang = en
# text = لكن انما ينبغى ان يستعمل نحو خارج القينة واخرها الحيلة اما بمقدار ما احٮملوا هولا المذكورين واما بمبلغ ما لا يمكن الانسان ان يقف ويعرف او بمبلغ ما يحتاجون اخيرا ڡى المقولة او القول وذلك ان كل شى نسلم الى الالهة يرى ويبصر
# transliteration = lākin innamā yanbaghī an yustaʿmala naḥwa khāriji l-qaynati wa-ākhirihā l-ḥīlatu immā bi-miqdāri mā iḥtamalū(?) hāʾulāʾi l-madhkūrīna wa-immā bi-mablaghi mā lā yumkinu l-insāna an yaqifa wa-yaʿrifa aw bi-mablaghi mā yaḥtājūna akhīran fī l-maqūlati awi l-qawli wa-dhālika anna kulla shayʾin nusallimu ilā l-ālihati yurā wa-yubṣaru
# prose_translation = But the contrivance should be used only toward what is outside the drama (?) and its end: either to the extent of what these aforementioned have borne (?), or to the extent of what a man cannot come upon and know, or to the extent of what they need at the last in diction or speech; for everything we commit to the gods is seen and beheld.
# literal_translation = But only it-is-fitting that be-used toward outside-of the-drama(?) and-its-end the-contrivance, either by-measure-of what they-bore(?) these the-mentioned, or by-extent-of what not is-possible the-man that he-stand and-know, or by-extent-of what they-need lastly in the-diction or the-speech; and-that [is] that every thing we-hand-over to the-gods is-seen and-is-beheld.
