# sent_id = 15.10d
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 15.10d
# translation_lang = en
# text = فاما ما هو خارج عن النطق فلا ينبغى ان يكون فى الامور والا كان هذا المعنى خارجا عن المدايح بمنزلة ما كان ما اتا به اوديقس من محاكاة سوفقلس حرٮصا
# transliteration = fa-ammā mā huwa khārijun ʿani l-nuṭqi fa-lā yanbaghī an yakūna fī l-umūri wa-illā kāna hādhā l-maʿnā khārijan ʿani l-madāʾiḥi bi-manzilati mā kāna mā atā bihī Ūdīqus min muḥākāti Sūfuqlis ḥarīṣan(?)
# prose_translation = As for what is outside reason, it ought not to be in the matters; otherwise this notion would be outside the praises, as was the case with what Oedipus (?) brought of Sophocles' imitation, eager (?).
# literal_translation = So-as-for what it [is] outside of the-reason, so-not it-is-fitting that it-be in the-matters; and-if-not was this the-notion outside of the-praises, like what was what brought with-it Oedipus of imitation-of Sophocles, eager(?).
