# text = وهذه ينبغى ان تحفظ ومع هذه ايضا الاحساسات التى تلزمهم فى صناعة الشعر من الاضطرار وذلك انه كثيرا ما قد يكون فى هذه زلل وخطا وقد تكلم فيها كلاما كافيا فى الاقاويل التى اتى بها
# transliteration = wa-hādhihi yanbaghī an tuḥfaẓa wa-maʿa hādhihi ayḍan al-iḥsāsātu allatī talzamuhum fī ṣināʿati l-shiʿri mina l-iḍṭirāri wa-dhālika annahū kathīran mā qad yakūnu fī hādhihi zalalun wa-khaṭaʾun wa-qad takallama fīhā kalāman kāfiyan fī l-aqāwīli allatī atā bihā
# prose_translation = These ought to be preserved, and with these also the perceptions that attend them in the art of poetry by necessity; for there is often slip and error in these. He has spoken of them sufficiently in the discourses that he produced.
# literal_translation = And-these it-is-fitting that be-preserved, and-with these also the-perceptions which attend-them in art-of the-poetry from the-necessity; and-that [is] that-it often indeed is in these slip and-error; and-indeed he-spoke in-them speech sufficient in the-discourses which he-brought with-them.
