# transliteration = wa-li-hādhā l-sababi ṣāra hādhā bi-l-qurbi mina l-zalali alladhī khubbira bihī wa-qad yūjadu ākharu yuqtaḍabu bi-ḥasabi hādhā l-raʾyi wa-hādhihi fīmā qālahū Sūfuqlis min annahū samiʿa ṣawta sāʿidin mumtahanin
# prose_translation = For this reason this came close to the slip that was reported. Another [kind] may be found that is improvised (?) according to this view; this is in what Sophocles said, that he heard the voice of a menial forearm (?).
