# translation_lang = en
# text = ودليل هذا هو ما تبكت به لڡادٯيٮس وذلك ان ذاك صعد فيما يقال الى ذاك كانه صاعد من اٮان اى من الهيكل من حيث لم يكن يرى وكان يذهب على الناظر ووقع فى الخيمة وعند ما يصعٮ السامعين فى هذا
# transliteration = wa-dalīlu hādhā huwa mā tubukkita bihī li-Fādqī?s wa-dhālika anna dhāka ṣaʿida fīmā yuqālu ilā dhāka ka-annahū ṣāʿidun min ?bān ay mina l-haykali min ḥaythu lam yakun yurā wa-kāna yadhhabu ʿalā l-nāẓiri wa-waqaʿa fī l-khaymati wa-ʿinda mā yaṣʿubu(?) l-sāmiʿīna fī hādhā
# prose_translation = The sign of this is what F[…] (?) was reproached for: that one went up, as is said, to that [place], as if going up from […] (?), that is, from the temple, whence he was not seen, and it escaped the spectator; and he fell in the tent, and when it was hard for (?) the listeners in this…
# literal_translation = And-sign-of this, it [is] what was-reproached for-it to-F[…](?); and-that [is] that that-one ascended, in-what is-said, to that, as-if-he ascending from […], that-is from the-temple, from where not was is-seen, and-was escapes upon the-onlooker; and-fell in the-tent; and-when is-hard(?) the-listeners in this…
