# text = اعنى فى الاقاويل والخرافات النى عملت وقد يجب عليه هو ايضا ان يكون عند ما يعمل ان يضعها على طريق الكلية ومن بعد ذلك ان ٮتحد يدخل شى وان بركب
# transliteration = aʿnī fī l-aqāwīli wa-l-khurāfāti allatī ʿumilat wa-qad yajibu ʿalayhi huwa ayḍan an yakūna ʿinda mā yaʿmalu an yaḍaʿahā ʿalā ṭarīqi l-kulliyyati wa-min baʿdi dhālika an yattakhidha(?) yudkhilu shayʾan wa-an yurakkiba(?)
# prose_translation = I mean in the discourses and the tales that have been made; and it is necessary for him too, when he makes [them], to set them out in the manner of the universal, and after that to take up (?) inserting something, and to compose (?).
# literal_translation = I-mean in the-discourses and-the-tales which were-made; and-indeed is-necessary upon-him, he also, that be, when he-makes, that he-set-them upon way-of the-universal, and-from after that that he-take(?) he-inserts thing, and-that he-compose(?).
