# sent_id = 17.6
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 17.6
# translation_lang = en
# text = واعنى بقولى ان يكون معنى الكل بهذا النحو كالحال فى امر ايباغانيا عند ما نحرت صبية ما واخفيت لكيما لا تظهر قامت بين المنحورين ووضعت فى بلد اخر فوق الٯايم قد كانت السنة جرت فى ذلك البلد ان يضحا لله ضحايا واقتنت هذا الفوز وفى زمان ما بالاخرة عرض ان قدم اخوها وجا من قبل ان الوالى احطا من قبل ان العلة هنالك خارج عن معنى الكل وفى البلد وايضا الذى عملت فيه هذه فماذى غير الخرافة مما يخبر به زعم ڡعل الان اد قد حٮت ولها اخذ وقدم ولٮتحد يعرف احيه فان على ما يعمل اوريفدس القينة على مذهب الحق اعواح كثيرة فلانه قال انه ليس اخته اذا كان يجب ان ٮتحد لكن هو ايضا قد كان يجب ان ٮمٮٮل فيه ذلك ومن هاهنا يكون الخلاص
# transliteration = wa-aʿnī bi-qawlī an yakūna maʿnā l-kulli bi-hādhā l-naḥwi ka-l-ḥāli fī amri Ībāghāniyā ʿinda mā nuḥirat ṣabiyyatun mā wa-ukhfiyat li-kaymā lā taẓhara qāmat bayna l-manḥūrīna wa-wuḍiʿat fī baladin ākhara fawqa l-qāʾimi(?) qad kānati l-sunnatu jarat fī dhālika l-baladi an yuḍaḥḥā lillāhi ḍaḥāyā wa-iqtanat hādhā l-fawza wa-fī zamānin mā bi-l-ākhirati ʿaraḍa an qadima akhūhā wa-jāʾa min qibali anna l-wāliya akhṭaʾa(?) min qibali anna l-ʿillata hunālika khārijun ʿan maʿnā l-kulli wa-fī l-baladi wa-ayḍan alladhī ʿumilat fīhi hādhihi fa-mādhā ghayru l-khurāfati mimmā yukhbaru bihī zaʿama faʿala l-āna idh qad jiʾta(?) wa-lahā ukhidha wa-quddima wa-li-yattakhidha(?) yaʿrifu akhīhi(?) fa-inna ʿalā mā yaʿmalu Ūrīfidus al-qaynata ʿalā madhhabi l-ḥaqqi aʿwājan(?) kathīratan fa-li-annahū qāla annahū laysa ukhtahū idhan kāna yajibu an ?t?d(?) lākin huwa ayḍan qad kāna yajibu an ?m??l(?) fīhi dhālika wa-min hāhunā yakūnu l-khalāṣu
# prose_translation = By my saying "that the sense of the universal be in this way" I mean: as in the case of Iphigenia, when a certain girl was slaughtered and hidden so that she would not appear, she stood among the slaughtered and was placed in another land, above the […] (?); the custom had long run in that land that sacrifices be offered to God; and she obtained this triumph. At some time, at the last, it befell that her brother arrived and came, because the governor erred (?), because the cause there is outside the sense of the universal, and [so is] the land also, and that in which these things were done. So what is outside the tale among what is reported? He claimed (?) he did [so] now, since you (?) had come; and for her he was seized and brought forward, so that he might take up (?) recognizing his brother (?). For in the way Euripides makes the drama according to the course of truth there are many crooked turns (?): because he said that she was not his sister; then it was necessary that […]; but he too had to be […] (?) in it; and from here comes the salvation.
# literal_translation = And-I-mean by-my-saying "that be sense-of the-universal in-this the-manner" like-the-case in matter-of Iphigenia: when was-slaughtered girl some and-was-hidden so-that not she-appear, she-stood among the-slaughtered, and-was-placed in land other above the-[…](?); indeed had the-custom run in that the-land that be-sacrificed to-God sacrifices; and-she-acquired this the-triumph. And-in time some at-the-last befell that arrived her-brother and-came, because that the-governor erred(?), because that the-cause there [is] outside of sense-of the-universal and-in the-land, and-also that-which were-done in-it these; so-what [is] other-than the-tale of-what is-reported with-it? he-claimed he-did now since indeed you-came(?), and-for-her he-was-taken and-was-brought-forward, and-so-that he-take(?) he-recognizes his-brother(?). So-verily upon what makes Euripides the-drama upon way-of the-truth [are] crooked-turns(?) many: so-because-he said that-it is-not his-sister, then was is-necessary that […]; but he also indeed was is-necessary that […] in-him that; and-from here is the-salvation.
