# sent_id = 17.10
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 17.10
# translation_lang = en
# text = وذلك ان لاودوسيا فالقول ليس هو بالطويل فانه عند ما شخص انسان وغاب سنين كثيرة قد ٮٮڡاق عن فوسيدس وقد كان وحيد وايضا فان حال من كانت حال انه الامر معها ان باد جميع املاكه فى الخطاب والملاملات وان يمكرون به ويحوبونه واما هو فبلغ بعد ان تاه تيه كثيرا ولما ٮڡرق اناس ما اما هو فشقا شقيا عظيما ونجا وتخلص واما اعداه فابادهم
# transliteration = wa-dhālika anna li-Ūdūsiyā fa-l-qawlu laysa huwa bi-l-ṭawīli fa-innahū ʿinda mā shakhaṣa insānun wa-ghāba sinīna kathīratan qad ??fāq(?) ʿan Fūsīdis wa-qad kāna waḥīdun wa-ayḍan fa-inna ḥāla man kānat ḥālun annahū l-amru maʿahā an bāda jamīʿu amlākihī fī l-khuṭṭābi wa-l-malāmalāti wa-an yamkurūna bihī wa-yaḥūbūnahū wa-ammā huwa fa-balagha baʿda an tāha tīhan kathīran wa-lammā tafarraqa(?) unāsun mā ammā huwa fa-shaqiya shaqiyyan ʿaẓīman wa-najā wa-takhallaṣa wa-ammā aʿdāʾuhū fa-abādahum
# prose_translation = For as for the Odyssey, the account is not long: when a man departed and was absent many years, […] (?) by Poseidon, and he was alone; and further, the state of those whose state it was — the matter with her being that all his possessions perished among the suitors and […] (?), and that they plot against him and […] (?) him. As for him, he arrived after wandering far; and when certain people dispersed (?), as for him, he suffered greatly, wretched, and escaped and was delivered; and as for his enemies, he destroyed them.
# literal_translation = And-that [is] that for-the-Odyssey, so-the-account is-not it long; so-verily-he, when departed a-man and-was-absent years many, indeed […](?) from Poseidon, and-indeed was alone; and-also so-verily state-of whom was a-state, that-it the-matter with-her [is] that perished all-of his-possessions among the-suitors and-the-[…](?), and-that they-plot against-him and-[…](?)-him; and-as-for he, so-he-arrived after that he-wandered wandering much; and-when dispersed(?) people some, as-for he, so-he-suffered wretched great, and-escaped and-was-delivered; and-as-for his-enemies, so-he-destroyed-them.
