# sent_id = 18.3
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 18.3
# translation_lang = en
# text = كحال رباط ثاوداقطس فى اوعى اما الارتباط فالتى تقدمت فكتبت واخذ الطفل وايضا فالتى علٮها واما الانحلال فذاك الذى هو من اوعى الى الموت والى الانقضى
# transliteration = ka-ḥāli ribāṭi Thāwdāqṭis fī Awʿā ammā l-irtibāṭu fa-llatī taqaddamat fa-kutibat wa-akhdhu l-ṭifli wa-ayḍan fa-llatī ʿalayhā wa-ammā l-inḥilālu fa-dhāka alladhī huwa min Awʿā ilā l-mawti wa-ilā l-inqiḍāʾi
# prose_translation = As in the case of the binding of Theodectes in Awʿā (?): as for the binding, it is what went before and was written (?), and the taking of the child, and again what is upon it; as for the dissolution, it is that which runs from Awʿā (?) to the death and to the end.
# literal_translation = Like-state-of binding-of Theodectes in Awʿā; as-for the-binding, so-which preceded and-was-written, and-taking-of the-child, and-also so-which [is] upon-it; and-as-for the-dissolution, so-that-one which it [is] from Awʿā to the-death and-to the-end.
