# sent_id = 18.10
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 18.10
# translation_lang = en
# text = وقد ينبغى الا يكون هم يوهلون كل انسان للخير الخاص به وقد كان يجب الا يكون لا مديح اخر ولا هذا ان يقال للخرافة وهذا اذا كان موجودا ڡٮالٮڡيه وحله هما باعيانهما
# transliteration = wa-qad yanbaghī allā yakūna hum yuʾahhilūna kulla insānin li-l-khayri l-khāṣṣi bihī wa-qad kāna yajibu allā yakūna lā madīḥun ākharu wa-lā hādhā an yuqāla li-l-khurāfati wa-hādhā idhā kāna mawjūdan fa-taʾlīfuhū(?) wa-ḥalluhū humā bi-aʿyānihimā
# prose_translation = And it ought not to be that they deem every man worthy of the good particular to him; and it should have been that there be neither another praise nor this one, that it be spoken of with respect to the fable (?); and this is when its combination (?) and its solution are present, the two being the same.
# literal_translation = And-indeed it-is-fitting that-not be they deem-worthy every man for-the-good the-particular to-him; and-indeed was it-is-necessary that-not be not praise other and-not this, that be-said for-the-fable; and-this [is] when was present its-combination(?) and-its-solution, they-two [are] by-their-selves.
