# prose_translation = And many of those which […] (?) [remain?] have in them nothing more of the fable, or of praise, than anything else; therefore only the interpolation […] (?), and the first to begin this was Agathon the poet. Yet there is no difference between […] (?) with interpolations and a speech being composed from one to another.
