# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 19.7
# translation_lang = en
# text = ونوع النظر للتى هى نحو المقولة هو نوعا واحدا مٮلا اشكال المقولة وهذه ترى للاخر بالوجوه والذى له مثل اعنى البنا وصناعة القيام عليه بمنزلة ما الامر وما الصلاة او حديث او حرض او سوال او جواب وان كان شى اخر مما هو نظير لهذه
# transliteration = wa-nawʿu l-naẓari li-llatī hiya naḥwa l-maqūlati huwa nawʿan wāḥidan mathalan(?) ashkālu l-maqūlati wa-hādhihi turā li-l-ākhari bi-l-wujūhi wa-lladhī lahū mithlun aʿnī l-bināʾa wa-ṣināʿata l-qiyāmi ʿalayhi bi-manzilati mā l-amru wa-mā l-ṣalātu aw ḥadīthun aw ḥaraḍun aw suʾālun aw jawābun wa-in kāna shayʾun ākharu mimmā huwa naẓīrun li-hādhihi
# prose_translation = The kind of study for the things that concern diction is a single kind, for example (?) the figures of diction; and these are seen by the other (?) in the faces (?), and by the one who has the like, I mean building and the art of being in charge of it: such as what a command is, and what a prayer is, or a narrative, or incitement (?), or a question, or an answer, and whatever else there may be that is similar to these.
# literal_translation = And-kind-of the-study for-which it [is] toward the-diction, it [is] kind one, for-example(?) figures-of the-diction; and-these are-seen for-the-other with-the-faces, and-who to-him [is] like, I-mean the-building and-art-of the-standing upon-it, in-the-rank-of what [is] the-command and-what the-prayer, or narrative or incitement(?) or question or answer, and-if was thing other of-what it [is] counterpart to-these.
