# sent_id = 19.8
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 19.8
# translation_lang = en
# text = وذلك انه لا شى اخر خارج عن علم هذه ولا علم من ما هو تهجين يوتا به فى صناعة الشعر يستحق الحرص والعناية والا فماذا للانسان ان يتوهم انه وقع الزلل فى التى كان فروطاغورس يهجن بها من انه كان يامر [ٮطں] عـٮر ما كاں يطں ان يصلى ويقول خبرى انه الاله على السخطة والحرد وذلك انه زعم ان معنى انه امر بان يفعل شى او لا يفعل هو امر
# transliteration = wa-dhālika annahū lā shayʾa ākhara khārijun ʿan ʿilmi hādhihi wa-lā ʿilma min mā huwa tahjīnun yuʾtā bihī fī ṣināʿati l-shiʿri yastaḥiqqu l-ḥirṣa wa-l-ʿināyata wa-illā fa-mādhā li-l-insāni an yatawahhama annahū waqaʿa l-zalalu fī llatī kāna Frūṭāghūras yuhajjinu bihā min annahū kāna yaʾmuru [yaẓunnu(?)] ghayra(?) mā kāna(?) yaẓunnu(?) an yuṣalliya wa-yaqūlu khabbirī anh(?) al-ilāhu ʿalā l-sakhṭati wa-l-ḥardi wa-dhālika annahū zaʿama anna maʿnā annahū amara bi-an yufʿala shayʾun aw lā yufʿala huwa amrun
# prose_translation = That is because there is nothing else outside the knowledge of these, and no lack of knowledge (?) of anything that is a censure brought against the art of poetry and deserving eagerness and care. Otherwise, what reason would a man have to suppose that an error occurred in that for which Protagoras used to censure [him], namely that he was commanding [he thought], contrary to what he thought, which was to pray, when he says: "Tell, O (?) god, of the wrath and anger"? That is because he claimed that the meaning of his ordering that something be done or not be done is a command.
# literal_translation = And-that [is] that-it no thing other [is] outside from knowledge-of these, and-no knowledge of what it [is] censure is-brought with-it in art-of the-poetry deserves the-eagerness and-the-care; and-otherwise so-what [is] for-the-man that he-suppose that-it occurred the-error in which was Protagoras censures with-it, from that-he was commands [thinks] other-than what was he-thinks that he-pray, and-says: tell-(fem.) ?O the-god upon the-wrath and-the-anger; and-that [is] that-he claimed that meaning-of that-he ordered with-that be-done thing or not be-done, it [is] command.
