# text = واما الاقتضاب صوت مركب مدلول مركب من اسطقس مصوت ولا مصوت وذلك ان الح والر بلا ا ليسا اقتضاب اذا كان انما يكون اقتضاب مع ا لكن الح والر وا هى اقتضاب الا انه ينبغى ان ننظر فى اختلاف هذه اعنى هذه الوزنية
# transliteration = wa-ammā l-iqtiḍābu ṣawtun murakkabun madlūlun murakkabun min usṭuqussin muṣawwitin wa-lā muṣawwitin wa-dhālika anna l-j(?) wa-l-r bi-lā a laysā iqtiḍāban idhā kāna innamā yakūnu iqtiḍābun maʿa a lākin al-j(?) wa-l-r wa-a hiya iqtiḍābun illā annahū yanbaghī an nanẓura fī ikhtilāfi hādhihi aʿnī hādhihi l-waznīyata
# prose_translation = As for the syllable, it is a composite sound, signified (?), composed of a vowel element and a non-vowel. For j (?) and r without a are not a syllable, since a syllable comes about only with a; but j and r and a are a syllable. We ought, however, to study the difference of these, I mean these metrical ones.
# literal_translation = And-as-for the-syllable, sound composite signified composed of element vowel and-non vowel; and-that [is] that the-j and-the-r without a are-not syllable, when was only is syllable with a; but the-j and-the-r and-a they [are] syllable; except that-it it-is-fitting that we-study in difference-of these, I-mean these the-metrical.
