# sent_id = 20.7
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 20.7
# translation_lang = en
# text = واما الواصلة فهى صوت مركب غير مدلول اما لابتدا القول واما لاخره او حد دال بمنزلة فاواو من اجل او الا يقال صوت مركب غير مدلول الذى لا يمنع ولا يفعل الصوت والواحد المدلول الذى من شانه ان يركب من اصوات كثيرة وعلى الروس وعلى الوسط
# transliteration = wa-ammā l-wāṣilatu fa-hiya ṣawtun murakkabun ghayru madlūlin immā li-ibtidāʾi l-qawli wa-immā li-ākhirihī aw ḥaddun dāllun bi-manzilati fāwāw(?) min ajli aw illā yuqālu ṣawtun murakkabun ghayru madlūlin alladhī lā yamnaʿu wa-lā yafʿalu l-ṣawta wa-l-wāḥida l-madlūla alladhī min shaʾnihī an yurakkaba min aṣwātin kathīratin wa-ʿalā l-ruʾūsi wa-ʿalā l-wasaṭi
# prose_translation = As for the connective, it is a composite sound without signification, either for the beginning of the statement or for its end, or a signifying boundary, such as fāwāw (?) [and] min ajli; or else it is said [to be] a composite sound without signification which neither prevents nor makes the sound and the one signified [sound] whose nature is to be composed of many sounds, both at the ends and in the middle.
# literal_translation = And-as-for the-connective, so-it [is] sound composite other-than signified, either for-beginning-of the-statement or for-its-end, or boundary signifying, in-the-rank-of fāwāw(?), min ajli; or otherwise is-said: sound composite other-than signified which not prevents and-not makes the-sound and-the-one the-signified, which from its-nature that it-be-composed from sounds many, and-upon the-heads and-upon the-middle.
