# sent_id = 20.8
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 20.8
# translation_lang = en
# text = واما الاسم فهو لفظة او صوت مركب دالة او دال خلو من الزمان جزو من اجزايه لا يدل على انفراده وليس يستعمل الاسما المركبة على ان جزو من اجزايها بدل على انفراده وذلك ان دورس من ثاودوس ليس يدل على شى
# transliteration = wa-ammā l-ismu fa-huwa lafẓatun aw ṣawtun murakkabun dāllatun aw dāllun khilwun mina l-zamāni juzʾun min ajzāʾihī lā yadullu ʿalā infirādihī wa-laysa yustaʿmalu l-asmāʾu l-murakkabatu ʿalā anna juzʾan min ajzāʾihā yadullu(?) ʿalā infirādihī wa-dhālika anna Dūrus min Thāwdūs laysa yadullu ʿalā shayʾin
# prose_translation = As for the noun, it is an expression or a composite sound, signifying, free of time, no part of whose parts signifies by itself. Composite nouns are not used as though a part of their parts signified by itself; for "dōrus" in "Theodōrus" does not signify anything.
# literal_translation = And-as-for the-noun, so-it [is] expression or sound composite, signifying(f.) or signifying(m.), free from the-time, part of its-parts not signifies upon its-singleness; and-not are-used the-nouns the-composite upon that part of their-parts signifies upon its-singleness; and-that [is] that dōrus of Theodōrus not signifies upon thing.
