# sent_id = 20.10
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 20.10
# translation_lang = en
# text = واما التصريف فهو للاسم او للقول اما ذاك على ان لهذا وهذا وما اشبه ذلك بعضه يدل على واحد او على كثير بمنزلة الناس او الانسان واما ذاك فعلى هذه التى هى والاقاويل بمنزلة ما فى السوال وفى الامر وذلك ان قولنا مشى او يمشى [اذا دللنا به على الزمان المستقبل] هما تصاريف الكلمة وهذه هى انواعها ايضا
# transliteration = wa-ammā l-taṣrīfu fa-huwa li-l-ismi aw li-l-qawli ammā dhāka ʿalā anna li-hādhā wa-hādhā wa-mā ashbaha dhālika baʿḍuhū yadullu ʿalā wāḥidin aw ʿalā kathīrin bi-manzilati l-nāsi awi l-insāni wa-ammā dhāka fa-ʿalā hādhihi allatī hiya wa-l-aqāwīli bi-manzilati mā fī l-suʾāli wa-fī l-amri wa-dhālika anna qawlanā mashā aw yamshī [idhā dalalnā bihī ʿalā l-zamāni l-mustaqbali] humā taṣārīfu l-kalimati wa-hādhihi hiya anwāʿuhā ayḍan
# prose_translation = As for inflection, it belongs to the noun or to the statement. One kind is according as [we say] "to this" and "this" and what resembles that; some of it signifies one or many, such as "the people" or "the man"; and another is according to these which are […] (?) and the statements, such as what is in question and in command. For our saying "walked" or "walks" [when we indicate by it future time] are inflections of the verb; and these are its kinds as well.
# literal_translation = And-as-for the-inflection, so-it [is] for-the-noun or for-the-statement; as-for that-one, upon that to-this and-this and-what resembled that; some-of-it signifies upon one or upon many, in-the-rank-of the-people or the-man; and-as-for that-one, so-upon these which they [are] and-the-statements, in-the-rank-of what [is] in the-question and-in the-command; and-that [is] that our-saying walked or walks [when we-indicated by-it upon the-time the-future] they-two [are] inflections-of the-verb, and-these they [are] its-kinds also.
