# translation_lang = en
# text = واما من النوع على فبمنزلة قوله ان انتزع نفسه بالنحاس عند ما قطع مں ٮه بنحاس حاد وذلك ان قولنا قطع هاهنا استعمله ووضعه بدل من قولنا قبل وذلك ان كلا القولين موضوعين على الموت
# transliteration = wa-ammā mina l-nawʿi ʿalā fa-bi-manzilati qawlihī an intazaʿa nafsahū bi-l-nuḥāsi ʿinda mā qaṭaʿa min(?) ?h(?) bi-nuḥāsin ḥāddin wa-dhālika anna qawlanā qaṭaʿa hāhunā istaʿmalahū wa-waḍaʿahū badalan min qawlinā qbl(?) wa-dhālika anna kilā l-qawlayni mawḍūʿayni ʿalā l-mawti
# prose_translation = As for [transference] from the species to […], it is like his saying that he drew out his soul with the bronze when he cut […] (?) with sharp bronze. For our word "cut" he here used and put in place of our word qbl (?); for both words are laid down for death.
# literal_translation = And-as-for from the-species upon, so-in-manner-of his-saying that he-drew-out his-soul with-the-bronze when he-cut from ? with-bronze sharp; and-that [is] that our-saying "cut" here he-used-it and-put-it instead of our-saying "qbl"; and-that [is] that both the-sayings [are] laid-down upon the-death.
