# translation_lang = en
# text = وفى هذه ليس اسم موضوع لهذه التى ٮالسٯيم الا انه لا شى يقال بالاقل على مثال واحد مثل ان دال الٮصراٮ ٮحلى واما الدال ففغرها من اشمس بلا تسمية الا ان حال هذه عند التسمية شبيه بحال الزرعة عند [غير] الثمرة ولذلك قد قيل ايضا ان الصامٮاٮ ٮعتب حلت من الاله
# transliteration = wa-fī hādhihi laysa ismun mawḍūʿun li-hādhihi allatī ?āls?īm(?) illā annahū lā shayʾa yuqālu bi-l-aqalli ʿalā mithālin wāḥidin mithla anna dālla l-?ṣrā?(?) ?ḥlī(?) wa-ammā l-dāllu fa-faghruhā min ashamsi(?) bi-lā tasmiyatin illā anna ḥāla hādhihi ʿinda l-tasmiyati shabīhun bi-ḥāli l-zarʿati ʿinda [ghayri] l-thamarati wa-li-dhālika qad qīla ayḍan inna l-ṣām?ā?(?) ?ʿtb(?) ḥallat mina l-ilāhi
# prose_translation = In some of these there is no noun laid down for these that […] (?); yet there is nothing that is said the less (?) according to one pattern: for example, that the signifier of the […] (?) is […] (?), whereas the signifier — its gaping (?) from the sun (?) — is without a name. Yet the relation of this to the naming (?) is like the relation of the sowing to [not] the fruit; and for that reason it has also been said that the […] (?) […] descended from the god.
# literal_translation = And-in these there-is-not noun laid-down for-these which ?, except that-it no thing is-said by-the-less upon pattern one, like that signifier-of the-? [is] ?; and-as-for the-signifier, so-its-gaping from the-sun [is] with-no naming; except that relation-of this at the-naming [is] similar to-relation-of the-sowing at [other-than] the-fruit; and-for-that indeed it-was-said also that the-? ? descended from the-god.
