# prose_translation = … unless a man makes all these, whose state is this state, [such] that his composition is in this state: either riddles and proverbs, or […] (barbarism?). If it is from transfer and transference, then [we get] enigmas, riddles and proverbs; and whoever (?) is from the "tongue", then […] (barbarism?).
