# text = وصورة الرمز فهو ان يقال ان التى هى موجودة لا يمكن ان يوصلها واما بحسب الاسما الاخر فلا يمكن ان يفعل هذا واما بحسب التادية والانتقال فقد يمكن مثل انه الصق الصاقا طاهرا النحاس بالنار والنحاس نفسه بالرجل
# transliteration = wa-ṣūratu l-ramzi fa-huwa an yuqāla inna allatī hiya mawjūdatun lā yumkinu an yūṣilahā wa-ammā bi-ḥasabi l-asmāʾi l-ukhari fa-lā yumkinu an yufʿala hādhā wa-ammā bi-ḥasabi l-taʾdiyati wa-l-intiqāli fa-qad yumkinu mithla annahū alṣaqa ilṣāqan ṭāhiran al-nuḥāsa bi-l-nāri wa-l-nuḥāsa nafsahū bi-l-rajuli
# prose_translation = The form of the enigma is that it be said that the things that exist cannot be joined; according to the other nouns this cannot be done, but according to transference and transfer it can: for example, that he glued, with a clean gluing, the bronze with the fire, and the bronze itself to the man.
# literal_translation = And-form-of the-enigma, so-it [is] that it-be-said that those-which they [are] existent, not is-possible that he-join-them; and-as-for by-reckoning-of the-nouns the-other, so-not is-possible that be-done this; and-as-for by-reckoning-of the-transference and-the-transfer, so-indeed is-possible: like that-he glued a-gluing clean the-bronze with-the-fire, and-the-bronze itself to-the-man.
