# text = وليس انما ينظم فى اتضاح المقولة جزوا يسيرا هذه الاشيا وهى هل اسم ما يكون بالنقصانات والتقطيعات وتبديلات الاسما وا*ـا من حيث هى حالها حال مختلفة او بان يكون حقيقى خارج عما جرت به العادة فيلزمه الا يعمل ناقص واما فمن حيث انه مشاركلبعاد فيكون مشهورا
# transliteration = wa-laysa innamā yanẓimu fī ittiḍāḥi l-maqūlati juzʾan yasīran hādhihi l-ashyāʾu wa-hiya hal ismun mā yakūnu bi-l-nuqṣānāti wa-l-taqṭīʿāti wa-tabdīlāti l-asmāʾi wa-a*ā min ḥaythu hiya ḥāluhā ḥālun mukhtalifatun aw bi-an yakūna ḥaqīqiyyun khārijan ʿammā jarat bihī l-ʿādatu fa-yalzamuhū allā yuʿmala nāqiṣun wa-ammā fa-min ḥaythu annahū mushārikulbʿād(?) fa-yakūnu mashhūran
# prose_translation = It is not merely a small part that these things contribute (?) to the clarity of diction; they are: whether a noun is [formed] by shortenings, cuttings and substitutions of the nouns; and […] insofar as their state is a different state, or by a proper [noun] being outside what custom has run with, it follows that it is not made deficient; and as for [the other], insofar as it shares in the customary (?), it will be well known.
# literal_translation = And-not merely arranges in clarity-of the-diction part small these the-things; and-they [are]: whether noun some is by-the-shortenings and-the-cuttings and-substitutions-of the-nouns; and-? from where they, their-state [is] state different, or by-that be proper outside of-what ran with-it the-custom, so-it-necessitates-it that-not be-made deficient; and-as-for, so-from where that-it [is] sharing-in-the-custom?, so-it-is well-known.
