# newpar id = chapter-23
# sent_id = 23.1
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 23.1
# translation_lang = en
# text = واما الاقتصاصى والوزن المحاكى فقد بين ان نخبر عنها الخرافات وحكاية الحديث على ما فى المديحات وان تقوم المتقينين والقينات نحو العمل الواحد متكامل باسره وهو الذى له اول ووسط واخر وهو الذى كما الحيوان العـ**ل للذة حاصية
# transliteration = wa-ammā l-iqtiṣāṣiyyu wa-l-waznu l-muḥākī fa-qad buyyina an nukhbira ʿanhā l-khurāfāti wa-ḥikāyata l-ḥadīthi ʿalā mā fī l-madīḥāti wa-an tuqawwima l-mutaqayyinīna(?) wa-l-qaynāti(?) naḥwa l-ʿamali l-wāḥidi mutakāmilin bi-asrihī wa-huwa alladhī lahū awwalun wa-wasaṭun wa-ākhirun wa-huwa alladhī kamā l-ḥayawānu l-ʿ**l li-l-ladhdhati khāṣṣiyyatan(?)
# prose_translation = As for the narrative [art] and the imitative metre, it has been made clear that we should relate through it the tales and the telling of the story, as is done in the praises, and that it should set up the mutaqayyinīn (?) and the singing-girls (?) toward the one action, complete in its entirety, namely the one that has a beginning, a middle and an end, and that which, like the animal […], is for pleasure as a property (?).
# literal_translation = And-as-for the-narrative and-the-metre the-imitating, so-indeed was-made-clear that we-relate about-it the-tales and-narration-of the-story upon what [is] in the-praises, and-that it-set-up the-mutaqayyinīn(?) and-the-singing-girls(?) toward the-action the-one complete in-its-entirety, and-it [is] that-which to-it [are] beginning and-middle and-end, and-it [is] that-which, as the-animal [...], [is] for-the-pleasure property(?).
