# text = ومن حيث لا يدخل فى هذه التركيبات اقتصاصات تشبه وهى التى قد ٮٮطر***ـا ان الاستدلال ليس انما هو لعمل واحد لكن لزمان واحد بمبلغ ما يعرض فى هذا وعمل واحد او كثير وكيف كل واحد واحد منها على ما لها انضافت الى قرينها كما كانت ا**رمنه انفسها
# transliteration = wa-min ḥaythu lā yadkhulu fī hādhihi l-tarkībāti iqtiṣāṣātun tushbihu wa-hiya allatī qad ??ṭr***ā anna l-istidlāla laysa innamā huwa li-ʿamalin wāḥidin lākin li-zamānin wāḥidin bi-mablaghi mā yaʿriḍu fī hādhā wa-ʿamalin wāḥidin aw kathīrin wa-kayfa kullu wāḥidin wāḥidin minhā ʿalā mā lahā inḍāfat ilā qarīnihā kamā kānati l-azminatu(?) anfusuhā
# prose_translation = And inasmuch as there do not enter into these compositions narratives that resemble [them] (?), these being the ones which […] that the demonstration is not only of one action but of one time, to the extent of what occurs in it, and of one action or many, and of how each single one of them, according to what it has (?), has been joined to its counterpart, as the times (?) themselves were.
# literal_translation = And-from where not enters in these the-compositions narratives [that] resemble, and-they [are] those-which indeed [...] that the-demonstration is-not only it [is] for-action one, but for-time one, by-extent-of what occurs in this, and-action one or many; and-how each one one of-them, upon what [is] to-it, was-joined to its-counterpart, as were the-times(?) themselves.
