# prose_translation = The sufficient limit for length is the limit that has been stated, namely the one in which there is the possibility in the beginning and the end; and this is what all the compositions of the ancients fall short of and are less than; but as for toward the praises that have a single session, more is brought forward.
# literal_translation = And-the-limit the-sufficient for-the-length it [is] that the-limit which was-said, and-it [is] that-which in-it [is] the-possibility in the-beginning and-the-end; and-this it [is] that-which all compositions-of the-ancients fall-short and-are-less; and-as-for toward the-praises which to-them [is] session one, is-brought with-them more.
