# sent_id = 24.6
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 24.6
# translation_lang = en
# text = ولها ايضا اعنى صنعة الافى المنسوبة الى ايلين وان تمتد فى طولها كثير من قبل انه فى المديح لا يمكن ان يكون غير ما كانت تقتص ويتحدث بها ان تتشبه باجزا كثيرة لكن بذلك الجزو الذى من المسكن وبالجزو الماخوذ من المرايين واما فى صناعة افى فيمكن ذلك من قبل ان المعنى للشعر فيها هو اقتصاص عظيم حتى انه يوجد لها فى عظم التها
# transliteration = wa-lahā ayḍan aʿnī ṣanʿata l-afī l-mansūbata ilā Īlīn wa-an tamtadda fī ṭūlihā kathīran min qibali annahū fī l-madīḥi lā yumkinu an yakūna ghayra mā kānat taqtaṣṣu wa-yataḥaddathu bihā an tatashabbaha bi-ajzāʾin kathīratin lākin bi-dhālika l-juzʾi alladhī mina l-maskani wa-bi-l-juzʾi l-maʾkhūdhi mina l-murāʾīna wa-ammā fī ṣināʿati afī fa-yumkinu dhālika min qibali anna l-maʿnā li-l-shiʿri fīhā huwa iqtiṣāṣun ʿaẓīmun ḥattā annahū yūjadu lahā fī ʿiẓami ālatihā(?)
# prose_translation = It also has, I mean the art of epic attributed to Īlīn (?), [the capacity] to extend much in its length; because in the praise it is not possible that imitating by many parts be other than what it was narrating and telling of, but [only] by that part which is from the dwelling and by the part taken from the dissemblers; whereas in the art of epic this is possible, because the intent of the poetry in it is a great narration, so that there is found for it, in the magnitude of its instrument (?) …
# literal_translation = And-to-it also, I-mean art-of the-epic the-attributed to Īlīn, and-that it-extend in its-length much; from account-of that-it in the-praise not is-possible that be other-than what was it-narrates and-is-told with-it, that it-imitate by-parts many, but by-that the-part which [is] from the-dwelling and-by-the-part the-taken from the-dissemblers; and-as-for in art-of epic, so-is-possible that, from account-of that the-meaning for-the-poetry in-it it [is] narration great, so-that that-it is-found to-it in magnitude-of its-instrument(?).
