# text = وقد يجب ان يعمل فى المديحات ما هو عجيب وهذا ***ں خاصة فى صنعة افى وهى الى الا العجيب فيها يعرض فى تسقيمها من قبل انه لا ينظر نحو العالم
# transliteration = wa-qad yajibu an yaʿmala fī l-madīḥāti mā huwa ʿajībun wa-hādhā ***n khāṣṣatan fī ṣanʿati afī wa-hiya ilā l-lā(?) l-ʿajību fīhā yaʿriḍu fī tasqīmihā min qibali annahū lā yunẓaru naḥwa l-ʿālami
# prose_translation = One must make in the praises what is marvellous; and this […] especially in the art of epic; and it tends toward the non-[…] (?): the marvellous occurs in it through its unsoundness (?), because one does not look toward the world (?).
# literal_translation = And-indeed it-is-necessary that he-make in the-praises what it [is] marvellous; and-this [...] especially in art-of epic; and-it [is] toward the-non(?), the-marvellous in-it occurs in its-unsoundness(?), from account-of that-it not is-looked toward the-world(?).
