# text = وينبغى ان يتفقد من امر الاسم متى كان ذاك على تضاد ما انه ٮدا** هذه التى قيلت على طريق الكمية بمنزلة ما قيل ان دورط النحاس تفرق ويدل هاهنا الى كثير ما امتنعت يده من ان يحل
# transliteration = wa-yanbaghī an yutafaqqada min amri l-ismi matā kāna dhāka ʿalā taḍāddin mā annahū ?dā** hādhihi allatī qīlat ʿalā ṭarīqi l-kammiyyati bi-manzilati mā qīla inna dūruṭ al-nuḥāsi tafarraqa wa-yadullu hāhunā ilā kathīrin mā imtanaʿat yaduhū min an yaḥulla
# prose_translation = And one ought to examine, in the matter of the noun, when it rests on some contradiction, that it […] these which were said by way of quantity, as in what was said: "the dory of bronze split (?)"; and it points here to how often his hand was prevented from loosing …
# literal_translation = And-it-is-fitting that be-examined from matter-of the-noun, when was that upon contradiction some, that-it […] these which were-said upon way-of the-quantity, in-position-of what was-said that dory-of the-bronze split; and-it-signifies here to much [that] was-prevented his-hand from that he-loose.
