# text = والانواع التى ياتون بها للتوبيخ والانتهار خمسة ****** ان ياتوا بها كالغير ممكنة واما كالتى هى دون الاستقامة او كالضاده او كالا*ر** *لـ* الصناعة او كالتى هى غير ناطقة والحلات فمن الاعداد التى قيلت ينبغى ان تتفقد وهى اثنا عشر
# transliteration = wa-l-anwāʿu allatī yaʾtūna bihā li-l-tawbīkhi wa-l-intihāri khamsatun ****** an yaʾtū bihā ka-l-ghayri mumkinatin wa-immā ka-llatī hiya dūna l-istiqāmati aw ka-l-ḍāddati aw ka-l-a*r** *l* al-ṣināʿati aw ka-llatī hiya ghayru nāṭiqatin wa-l-ḥallātu(?) fa-mina l-aʿdādi allatī qīlat yanbaghī an tutafaqqada wa-hiya ithnā ʿashara
# prose_translation = The kinds by which they bring rebuke and reproach are five: […] that they bring them as not possible, or as what falls short of correctness, or as contrary, or as […] the art, or as what is irrational. The solutions (?) ought to be examined from the numbers that were stated; and they are twelve.
# literal_translation = And-the-kinds which they-bring with-them for-the-rebuke and-the-reproach [are] five: […] that they-bring them as-the-non possible, or as-which it [is] below the-correctness, or as-the-contrary, or as-the-[…] […] the-art, or as-which it [is] other-than rational; and-the-solutions(?), so-from the-numbers which were-said it-is-fitting that they-be-examined, and-they [are] two ten.
