# sent_id = 26.3
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 26.3
# translation_lang = en
# text = وذلك انه من قبل انهم لا يحسون لا ٮرٮد هم الحركة الكبيرة وذلك ان الذين يتحركون فمثل الذين يزمرون فى الٮٮات والسرنيات المزيفة المزورة عير ما يستدارون ويحاكون اٮن ٮسٯوٮا*** سٮهون به عند [غير] ما ٮحربون الراس ان كان الزمر الذى يزمرونه لاسقولا
# transliteration = wa-dhālika annahū min qibali annahum lā yuḥissūna lā yazīdu(?) hum al-ḥarakata l-kabīrata wa-dhālika anna alladhīna yataḥarrakūna fa-mithlu alladhīna yazmirūna fī l-nāyāti(?) wa-l-surnāyāti l-muzayyafati l-muzawwarati ghayra(?) mā yustadārūna wa-yuḥākūna ?n ?s?w?ā*** sh?hūna(?) bihī ʿinda [ghayri] mā ?ḥr?ūna(?) l-raʾsa in kāna l-zamru alladhī yazmirūnahū li-Isqūlā
# prose_translation = That is because, since they do not perceive [unless] he adds (?), they [make] the great movement; that is, those who move are like those who pipe on the bad, counterfeit reed-pipes (?) and shawms, […] being turned about, and they imitate […] and liken (?) by it, when they [drag (?)] the head, if the piping they pipe is for Scylla.
# literal_translation = And-that [is] that-it, from account-of that-they not perceive, not he-adds(?), they [make] the-movement the-great; and-that [is] that those-who move, so-like those-who pipe on the-reed-pipes(?) and-the-shawms the-counterfeit the-forged, other-than(?) [that] they-are-turned-about and-they-imitate […] […] they-liken(?) by-it when [other-than] [that] they-?drag the-head, if was the-piping which they-pipe-it for-Scylla.
