# sent_id = 26.6
# document_id = 0086-034
# text_lang = ara
# subdoc = 26.6
# translation_lang = en
# text = ولنا ان نقول نحو هذه انه اما اولا ان الاختصام ليس هو صناعة الشعر لكن تلك التى هى للمراياة والنفاق من قبل انه قد يوجد الى ان ٮٮطل بالرسوم عند ما يغنى وما كان يفعله سوسطراطس وعند ما يزعق ويزمر وهو ما كان يفعله مسٮٮٮاس *طٮٮٮطيا بعد ذاك
# transliteration = wa-lanā an naqūla naḥwa hādhihi innahū ammā awwalan inna l-ikhtiṣāma laysa huwa ṣināʿata l-shiʿri lākin tilka allatī hiya li-l-murāʾāti wa-l-nifāqi min qibali annahū qad yūjadu ilā an yubṭila(?) bi-l-rusūmi ʿinda mā yughannī wa-mā kāna yafʿaluhū Sūsṭrāṭus wa-ʿinda mā yazʿaqu wa-yazmiru wa-huwa mā kāna yafʿaluhū M???ās *ṭ???ṭiyā baʿda dhāka
# prose_translation = And we may say about these that, first, the charge is not [against] the art of poetry but [against] that which belongs to ostentation and hypocrisy; because it happens that one goes so far as to spoil (?) [it] with signs when singing, which is what Sosistratus used to do, and when shouting and piping, which is what Mnasitheus […] used to do after that.
# literal_translation = And-for-us that we-say toward these that-it: as-for first, verily the-dispute not-is it art-of the-poetry, but that which it [is] for-the-ostentation and-the-hypocrisy; from account-of that-it indeed is-found to that he-spoil(?) with-the-signs when he-sings, and-what was doing-it Sosistratus; and-when he-shouts and-pipes, and-it [is] what was doing-it Mnasitheus […] after that.
