# text = وايضا ولا كل حركة من دوله كما انه ولا كل *** الا يكون رقص هولا المزيفين وهو ما قد كان قاليفيدس يبكت عليه وما **كٮ عليه فى هذا الوقت قوم اخرون من غير ما لا يشتهون بالنسا **حر***صا صناعة
# transliteration = wa-ayḍan wa-lā kullu ḥarakatin min dawlatin(?) kamā annahū wa-lā kullu *** illā yakūnu raqṣa hāʾulāʾi l-muzayyafīna wa-huwa mā qad kāna Qālīfīdis yubakkatu ʿalayhi wa-mā **katu ʿalayhi fī hādhā l-waqti qawmun ākharūna min ghayri mā lā yashtahūna bi-l-nisāʾi **ḥr***ṣā ṣināʿatin
# prose_translation = Again, not every movement is from dawla (?), just as not every […] [is], unless it be the dance of these base people; and that is what Callippides used to be censured for, and what other people are [censured] for at this time, apart from their not desiring (?) women […] art.
# literal_translation = And-also and-not every movement [is] from dawla(?), as that-it and-not every […], except be dance-of these the-counterfeit-ones; and-it [is] what indeed was Callippides censured for-it, and-what [are] [cen]sured for-it in this the-time people other, from other-than [that] not they-desire with-the-women […] art.
